  "mode": "acceptance",
  "rationale": "覆盖已证等价的纯函数族（参数可 JSON 序列化）：selection、prime_sieve、logarithm、integer_power、quantity_duration。对象类族（fractal/chaotic/quantity_arithmetic/shared_*/coordinate_materialization）与枚举参数族（trivalent）需要构造器或枚举名解析，不在本政策 v1 范围内。v2 追加 elementary_operators（12 个公开算子完整调用）、unit_registry（5 个身份闸门）、public_array_access（5 个受检读写）、storage_and_view（4 个存储/视图变换）与 shared_array_ops（5 个共享数组算子）。/ Covers the JSON-argument families that were verified equivalent; object-constructing and enum-argument families are out of scope for policy v1. v2 adds elementary_operators (12 complete public operator calls) unit_registry (5 identity gates) public_array_access (5 checked accesses) storage_and_view (4 storage/view transforms) and shared_array_ops (5 shared-array operators).。v3 追加 binding_multiarray（7 个绑定层自身方法的直接调用：to_list / transpose / equals / describe / view / iter_snapshot / from_list）——B240 指出 29 条 `_binding.multiarray` 契约此前没有任何门禁用例，公共外观层的用例只是间接经过它。 / v3 adds binding_multiarray: 7 cases that call the binding layer's own methods directly, because B240 found 29 `_binding.multiarray` contracts with no gate case of their own (the public-facade cases only pass through them indirectly).",
  "threshold": 1.15,
  "gated_minimum": 10000,
  "note_on_count": "对固定开销的微调用，count 是'该用例参与判定'的标签而非输入规模；对大输入族（prime_sieve）count 同时代表输入规模。/ For fixed-cost calls, count marks the case as gated; for size-parameterised families it is the actual input size.",
