  "note_on_scope": "本门禁比较的是「当前树」与「归档的切换前基线树」——两者都走同一条原生路径。因此它判定的是「有无回归」，**不能**作为「原生是否比被替换的 Python 实现更快」的证据，也不能用来关闭 `complete-call-performance-and-resource-budgets` 这类预算合同。后者需要以 Python 内建为基线单独测量（见 B237/B238 的 30 条撤销）。 / This gate compares the current tree against the archived pre-cutover baseline tree; both go through the same native path, so it judges regression only. It is NOT evidence that native is faster than the Python implementation it replaced, and must not be used to close budget contracts.",
  "note_on_scope_v3": "v3 的 7 个 binding_multiarray 用例同样只判「有无回归」，**不能**用来关闭 `complete-call-performance-and-resource-budgets` 类契约；且它们无法覆盖 `at_many` / `get` 两个新方法（归档基线树里还没有这两个方法）。 / The 7 v3 binding cases also only detect regressions and cannot close budget contracts; they cannot cover the new at_many/get methods because the archived baseline tree predates them.",
  "note_on_batch": "临界用例（2x3 单次约 3,100 ns）用 batch=32 / repeats=64：每个样本做 32 次调用再除以 32，样本跨度约 109 µs，是 Windows perf_counter_ns 约 100 ns 分辨率的 1,090 倍；总调用次数 32×64=2,048 与原来 repeats=2,048 相当，不放大工作量。此前单次计时只有约 4.6 个量化步的判定余量，导致比值逐次漂移（B372/B375）。 / Marginal cases use batch=32 with repeats=64: each sample spans ~109 µs, ~1,090x the ~100 ns clock resolution, while total calls (32x64=2,048) match the original repeats count.",
  "note_on_dto": "DTO 构造用例用 builder=dto 测「构造一个数据类」的完整开销；params.kwargs 里的字符串若命中夹具名（unit / ref）则替换为夹具对象。 / DTO cases measure the complete cost of constructing one dataclass.",
  "note_on_also_covers": "`also_covers` 声明用例端到端穿过的额外 (模块, 符号)，供预算标签的证据判定使用。 / `also_covers` declares extra (module, symbol) pairs a case exercises end to end."
}
